@startuml SequenceDiagramProjectWBS
' Sequence Diagram: Full WBS Planning & Task Conversion Flow

autonumber
actor User
participant "Nuxt Frontend\n(BookModal / WBS UI)" as FE
participant "ProjectsController" as PC
participant "PlanningService" as PS
participant "WBSService" as WS
participant "WbsValidationService" as VS
participant "TaskConversionService" as CS
participant "TasksService" as TS
participant "GeminiService" as GS
database "MongoDB" as DB

== 1. Catchball & SMART Objective ==
User -> FE : Start Project AI Assistant
FE -> PC : POST /projects/:id/plan-with-ai
PC -> PS : planWithAi(projectId, userContext)
PS -> GS : generateCatchballQuestions(context)
GS --> PS : Return Strategic Questions
PS --> FE : Prompt User for Clarifications

User -> FE : Submit Responses
FE -> PC : POST /projects/:id/refine-objective
PC -> PS : refineObjective(projectId, answers)
PS -> GS : generateSmartObjective(answers)
GS --> PS : SMART Objective JSON
PS -> DB : Update Project Document
PS --> FE : Return SMART Objective

== 2. WBS Tree Generation & Validation ==
User -> FE : Generate WBS Tree
FE -> PC : POST /projects/:id/generate-wbs
PC -> WS : generateWbs(projectId)
WS -> GS : promptWbsDecomposition(smartObjective)
GS --> WS : Raw WBS Hierarchy JSON
WS -> VS : validateAndNormalizeWbs(rawWbs)
VS -> VS : Check 8/80 Hours Rule & Budget Cap
VS --> WS : Validated WBS Tree
WS -> DB : Save WBS to Project
WS --> FE : Return Interactive WBS Tree

== 3. WBS Conversion to Tasks ==
User -> FE : Approve WBS & Convert to Tasks
FE -> PC : POST /projects/:id/wbs/convert-to-tasks
PC -> CS : convertWbsToTasks(projectId)
CS -> GS : enrichLeafNodesWithPertAndChecklist(leafNodes)
GS --> CS : Enriched Task Payloads
CS -> TS : createMany(tasksPayload, options)
TS -> TS : Calculate PERT Expected Time & CPM Critical Path
TS -> DB : Bulk Insert Task Documents
TS --> CS : Confirmation
CS --> FE : Return Created Tasks & CPM Critical Path Summary

@enduml
